<p>When you make your pustules explode you leave a pool of defiled blood on the ground for 5 turns.</p><p>Foes caught inside get assaulted by black tentacles every turn, dealing 10% darkness tentacle damage and covering them in your black blood for 2 turns.</p><p>Creatures that hit you while covered in your blood heal you for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">17%, 23%, 27%, 31%, 35%</acronym> of the damage done.</p><p>The healing received increases with your Spellpower.</p>